      "decision": "Document the two public clauses split inside Hebrew Psalm 13:6.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
      "location": "42:1-72:20",
      "decision": "Keep Book II's thirst, communal loss, royal hope, justice, and praise together.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
      "location": "73:1-89:52",
      "decision": "Preserve Book III's crisis of justice, sanctuary insight, communal devastation, and covenant protest.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
      "location": "90:1-106:48",
      "decision": "Keep Book IV's answer in divine kingship, human frailty, creation, memory, and praise.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
